{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#2141","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#2141","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#2141\",\"parent_revision\":\"0d3f342ba094012da9588a801c665d94525b81f78bacb0694ed3c868dbe7ce5b\",\"root_revision\":\"0d3f342ba094012da9588a801c665d94525b81f78bacb0694ed3c868dbe7ce5b\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: \\ntype: Feature\\nstatus: closed\\nadded: \\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nAfter a dh:task-worker or QG agent completes, sam_plan(action='status') still shows the task as \\\"not-started\\\". The orchestrator must manually call sam_task(action='state', status='complete') to advance the plan.\\n\\n**Observed behavior**: Every task agent completion in plan Pf9408259 and Pff8e2875 required a manual status fix. This was reproduced 7+ times across both plans in session 1d8bdb04.\\n\\n**Investigation findings** (from hooks investigation agent, session 1d8bdb04, 2026-05-05):\\n\\nThe SubagentStop hook (task_status_hook.py, registered in hooks/hooks.json with 30s timeout) resolves which task to mark complete by calling sam_active_task(action='get', session_id=<sub_agent_session_id>). That lookup returns nothing if the agent never called sam_active_task(action='set') to register itself.\\n\\nTwo failure paths identified from reading the source files:\\n1. Agents dispatched via direct Agent() calls (not via the start-task skill) do not execute the sam_active_task(action='set') step in start-task/SKILL.md lines 109-119. The hook finds no active task record and exits 0 silently.\\n2. The 30s SubagentStop timeout kills the cold fastmcp subprocess (uv + SAM server startup) before the status update completes.\\n\\n**Key files**:\\n- plugins/development-harness/hooks/hooks.json (SubagentStop registration, 30s timeout)\\n- plugins/development-harness/skills/implementation-manager/scripts/task_status_hook.py (hook script)\\n- plugins/development-harness/skills/start-task/SKILL.md lines 109-119 (sam_active_task set call)\\n\\n**Impact**: Every orchestrated plan requires manual status corrections, making the SAM progress loop unreliable without orchestrator intervention.\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] Work matches description\\n- [ ] Plan or implementation complete\\n</div>\\n\\n## Story\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAs a **developer relying on this plugin**, I want to **fix: sam task status not auto-updated after agent completion (subagentstop hook fails silently)** so that **the tool works correctly and reliably**.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Observed during /dh:work-backlog-item --auto #2102 session 1d8bdb04, 2026-05-05. Investigation agent confirmed root cause by reading hook source files.\\n- **Priority**: P1\\n- **Added**: 2026-05-05\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"a8dbd43990e18d03fbbdb8cbddab0ddc7bbb90cb059c43cda4eeca3ff4822921\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABVCbVow\"}"}